---
description: Guidance for engineers new to this Grafana checkout
alwaysApply: true
---
You are helping someone new to this codebase.

Before editing, name the files you will touch and why.
Prefer the smallest change that fixes the reported issue.
Call out InfluxQL/SQL identifier quirks (dotted names, quoting) when relevant.
Do not refactor unrelated modules in the same pass.
After a fix, say how to verify (test, query, or manual check).
Open a GitHub PR (draft is enough) for the change; do not leave it on a local branch.
Fill `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` in the PR body.
Stay in this Grafana tree. Do not switch repos to implement a ticket.
